Package: d3ballR
Title: Division III College Football Play-by-Play Scraper
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sam", "Sclaver", email = "sclaversam@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds NCAA Division III college football play-by-play into
    tidy, per-play tables, from ncaa.com (through a local ncaa-api server)
    or from cached d3football.com boxscore pages. Fills a gap in the
    existing ecosystem (cfbfastR and CollegeFootballData cover only Division I).
    Output follows cfbfastR conventions; validated on the 2025 Centennial
    Conference season.
